        <mxCell id="c62" value="&lt;i&gt;Each section is built from the requirements named beside it, and each exhibit comes from the requirement that made it: Requirement&amp;nbsp;2 for Exhibit&amp;nbsp;1, Requirement&amp;nbsp;3 for Exhibits&amp;nbsp;2 and 3, Requirement&amp;nbsp;4 for Exhibit&amp;nbsp;4, Requirement&amp;nbsp;5 for Exhibit&amp;nbsp;5. The opening is written in Requirement 6 once the rest is known, and the recommendation rests on Requirements 2 to 5. Block heights are schematic.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="314" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
